## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical React Native fundamentals: data fetching, local persistence, list rendering performance, and graceful error handling in a fintech scenario.

## Key Concepts
- FlatList and RefreshControl for smooth UI
- AsyncStorage offline caching strategy
- Error handling and retry patterns
